ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS

This project was inspired by and built upon concepts from:

  Polylux
    https://github.com/vladulus/polylux
    Author: vladulus
    "Open-source replacement for ASUS Armoury Crate. Drives ROG hardware
    (AniMe Matrix, LiveDash OLED, Ryujin LCD, Aura RGB, fan PWM)
    without 700MB of bloat."

Protocol reverse engineering was also informed by:

  asusctl / rog-anime
    https://gitlab.com/asus-linux/asusctl
    Authors: flukejones and contributors
    License: Mozilla Public License 2.0

  g-helper
    https://github.com/seerge/g-helper
    License: MIT

The HID wire format for the ROG Strix Flare II Animate (VID=0x0B05 PID=0x19FC)
was independently confirmed via live USBPcap traffic analysis.
